Expected behavior
It seems that libtorch is doing some auto-optimization on those slower loops.
This will help speed things up later.
But this feature doesn't fit our usage scenario, and hurts our program performance.
3 seconds for 20 loops  = more than 60 seconds. This is not acceptable for our application.
